Features:
- you can select the countries in several ways (alphabetically, next, click);
- the map shows your position and at the same time the capitals of all nations;
- you can move freely on the map, using the + and - keys or your fingers to zoom;
- click on each pin and get the distance in miles and kilometers between you and the selected capital;
- find out the information if you want to know more than one country;
- have fun with the game of flags and get the highest score;
- working language: English, Italian;
- you can choose between light and dark mode;
- does not require internet connection;
- works with the GPS function that is required when using the app for the first time;
- no private data is requested or stored in the app.

